---
layout: base.njk
title: "What We Do — Camwyn & Co."
---

<!-- Hero Section -->
<section class="u-py-section u-border-bottom">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">Ventures &amp; Collaborations</p>
    <h1 class="c-hero__title">Ideas made useful. Systems made to last.</h1>
    <p class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--color-primary); max-width: 42ch; margin-top: var(--space-md);">
      We don't offer generic service packages. We build our own ventures and help good people turn what they know into <span class="u-text-clay">something that works.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Active Operating Ventures Grid -->
<section class="u-py-section u-bg-warm-sand u-border-bottom">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-sm); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);">
      <p class="c-hero__eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 0;">Work Under Our Roof</p>
      <div x-show="$store.compass.result" x-cloak class="u-font-mono" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-muted-clay-text);">
        <span>Resonance for: <strong x-text="$store.compass.archetypes[$store.compass.result]?.name"></strong></span>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="o-grid" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-lg);">
      {% for v in ventures %}
        <div style="border-top: 2px solid var(--color-primary); padding-top: var(--space-md);" x-data="{ resonance: {{ v.resonance | dump | safe }} }">
          <p class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--color-muted-clay-text);">{{ v.num }} · {{ v.category }}</p>
          <h3 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.75rem; margin: 0.5rem 0;">{{ v.title }}</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
            {{ v.description }}
          </p>

          <!-- Dynamic Archetype Resonance Box -->
          <div 
            x-show="$store.compass.result && resonance[$store.compass.result]" 
            x-cloak
            style="margin-bottom: 1.25rem; padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem; background: var(--color-surface-container-low); border-left: 2px solid var(--color-muted-clay); font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--color-on-surface); border-radius: 0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;"
          >
            <span class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.6875rem; color: var(--color-muted-clay-text); display: block; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">
              ★ Where <span x-text="$store.compass.archetypes[$store.compass.result]?.name || 'You'"></span> Shines
            </span>
            <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.45;" x-text="resonance[$store.compass.result]"></p>
          </div>

          <a href="{{ v.link }}" class="u-font-mono u-text-uppercase" style="font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">
            {{ v.linkLabel }}
          </a>
        </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- How We Work Together (Engagement Modes) -->
<section class="u-py-section">
  <div class="o-container o-container--wide">
    <div class="o-grid" style="align-items: start;">
      <div style="grid-column: span 5;">
        <p class="c-hero__eyebrow">Engagement Modes</p>
        <h2 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 2.25rem; color: var(--color-primary);">Ways to pull up a chair.</h2>
      </div>

      <div style="grid-column: span 7; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-lg);">
        <div>
          <h4 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">1. Technical &amp; Operational Sparring</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); line-height: 1.6;">
            Starting with a problem you’ve been staring at for months. We look at software architecture, underlying operations, and workflows to find the smartest, most durable path forward.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">2. System &amp; Brand Architecture</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); line-height: 1.6;">
            Building the actual structure—whether developing software, mapping out an operational workflow, clarifying brand positioning, or setting up durable technical foundations.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h4 class="u-font-serif" style="font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--color-primary); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">3. Long-Term Collaboration</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: var(--color-on-surface-variant); line-height: 1.6;">
            Joining as steady partners for ventures that take time to grow. We protect space for experiment, craft, and execution over the long haul.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>